    "A legacy of excellence in global infrastructure and investment, bridging development between nations.": "在全球基础设施和投资领域的卓越传承，架起国家间发展的桥梁。",
    "Our Story and Global Presence": "我们的故事与全球影响力",
    "Mutual Commitment Company Ltd (MCC) was founded with a singular vision: to become a bridge for development between nations. With decades of experience, we have grown into a multinational conglomerate with a significant footprint in Africa and Asia.": "互信承诺公司有限公司（MCC）成立之初怀有一个单一愿景：成为国家间发展的桥梁。凭借数十年的经验，我们已成长为一家在非洲和亚洲拥有重要影响力的跨国集团。",
    "Our operations are centered on delivering high-impact engineering projects, from massive transport networks to energy systems that power entire communities. We don't just build structures; we build the foundations for economic growth.": "我们的业务以实施高影响力工程项目为核心，从大型交通网络到为整个社区供电的能源系统。我们不仅仅是建造结构；我们在建设经济增长的基础。",
    "With headquarters in both Nigeria and China, we leverage international expertise and local knowledge to deliver projects that are both state-of-the-art and tailored to local needs.": "凭借在尼日利亚和中国的双总部优势，我们将国际专业知识与本地知识相结合，提供既先进又符合本地需求的项目。",
