    "At MCC, we believe that infrastructure is only as strong as the people who build it. Our talent development programs are core to our mission of shared prosperity.": "在MCC，我们相信基础设施的力量来自于建造它的人。我们的人才发展项目是我们共同繁荣使命的核心。",
    "Building Local Capacity, Meeting Global Standards": "培养本地能力，达到全球标准",
    "We are committed to maintaining a workforce that is at least 85% local in every country we operate. This is more than a policy; it is a commitment to long-term economic stability and technological transfer.": "我们致力于在我们运营的每个国家保持至少85%本地员工。这不仅仅是一项政策；这是对长期经济稳定和技术转让的承诺。",
    "Through our training centers in Nigeria and China, we provide specialized education in engineering, project management, and sustainable construction practices.": "通过我们在尼日利亚和中国的培训中心，我们提供工程、项目管理和可持续建设实践方面的专业教育。",
